---
import Button from "../Button.astro";

const appFee = "₹1,000";
const dmHref = "https://wa.me/917015330518?text=AGENT";
const dmCta = `DM "AGENT" to know more`;
---

<section id="register" class="register">
  <div class="wrap grid-2">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">Register</p>
      <h2>20 seats per town. <span class="gold">Ek hi cohort.</span></h2>
      <p class="lead">
        {appFee} covers registration and the notary for your agreement. The program fee is due
        only after you have a job offer of ₹3 LPA or more, payable as an
        agreed share of salary in installments &mdash; {appFee} is the only
        thing you pay before you're hired, and only after you've seen two
        free sessions.
      </p>
      <div class="steps">
        <p><span class="num">1</span>DM &ldquo;AGENT&rdquo; on WhatsApp, or call either number.</p>
        <p><span class="num">2</span>Do the homework evaluation &mdash; a short voice interview and one written task. Doing it at all is the first filter.</p>
        <p><span class="num">3</span>Attend two free sessions and build your first small agent before paying anything.</p>
        <p><span class="num">4</span>Decide at the end of session 2: pay the {appFee}, sign the notarised agreement, take your seat. Twenty seats per town, first come first held.</p>
      </div>
      <p class="footnote">
        Questions before you apply? Message or call, and say whether you're a
        fresher or already working. Vague inputs get vague replies.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="card card-gold dm-card">
      <p class="eyebrow">Apply on WhatsApp or call</p>
      <p class="phone"><a href="tel:+919728485250">+91 97284 85250</a></p>
      <p class="phone"><a href="tel:+917015330518">+91 70153 30518</a></p>
      <p class="dm-lead">
        Message &ldquo;AGENT&rdquo; and tell me whether you're a fresher or
        already working, plus the shop, clinic or office you'd point an
        agent at first.
      </p>
      <Button size="lg" href={dmHref} class="dm-cta" data-cta="register">{dmCta}</Button>
      <p class="fine">Opens WhatsApp on +91 70153 30518. {appFee} registration fee, paid only after the free sessions, and there is no waitlist once seats are filled.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .register { background: var(--surface-page); }

  .grid-2 {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(320px, 1fr));
    gap: 56px;
    align-items: start;
  }

  h2 { margin: 0 0 20px; }
  .lead { font-size: 1.0625rem; line-height: 1.55; margin: 0 0 28px; max-width: 46ch; }

  .steps { display: grid; gap: 14px; margin-bottom: 28px; }
  .steps p {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.55;
    color: var(--text-body);
    padding-left: 26px;
    position: relative;
    max-width: none;
  }
  .steps .num { position: absolute; left: 0; top: 0; color: var(--gold-300); font-weight: 600; }

  .footnote {
    padding-top: 24px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border-hairline);
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    color: var(--text-subtle);
    line-height: 1.55;
    margin: 0;
    max-width: none;
  }

  .dm-card { display: flex; flex-direction: column; }

  .phone {
    margin: 0 0 8px;
    font-size: 1.75rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--text-heading);
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    max-width: none;
  }
  .phone a { color: inherit; text-decoration: none; }
  .phone + .dm-lead { margin-top: 8px; }

  .dm-lead { font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.55; margin: 0 0 28px; max-width: none; }

  .dm-card :global(.dm-cta) { width: 100%; }

  .dm-card .fine { font-size: 0.75rem; color: var(--text-faint); margin: 16px 0 0; line-height: 1.32; max-width: none; }
</style>
